CDialogTree
{
Name=The Inner Sanctum
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=0
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the sanctum
Text=This is not a chamber the druids use. There is no circle cut in the floor and nothing has been burned in here. What there is, is a great deal of wall for a room this size -- and the wall does not ring the same all the way round.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 the stones
Text=Three stones are set into the wall here at shoulder height, worn paler than the rest by hands that knew exactly where to reach. Three stones, and a very long way between them and whatever they open.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 the north door
Text=Stone grinds on stone somewhere behind you to the north, and then a great many boots start moving at once. Whatever that stone opened, it was not a cupboard. Two stones left.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=4 the chests
Text=A panel swings back in the eastern wall on two strongboxes with the Temple's mark still on the lids -- taken off the Order on the way in, and never opened by whoever took them. Two stones left.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 the south door
Text=The grinding comes from the south this time, and with it a smell of hot iron and wet stone. The druids kept something in there that does not need feeding. Two stones left.
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
